// drainListener is a net.Listener whose Close is synchronized with in-flight
// Accept calls. http.Server.Shutdown invokes Close while holding its own
// listener lock, so by the time Shutdown proceeds every blocked Accept on a
// drained listener has returned and the server can no longer dispatch a new
// connection.
